!
! This test calculates the energy and dipole moment
! of the water molecule at different levels of theory.
! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals
! by using the LVCORR option in the general section.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Energies, dipole moment.
.WAVE F
.PROPER
.4INDEX
**GENERAL
.LVCORR
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8
**PROPERTIES
.DIPOLE
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
all
.PRPTRA
*PRPTRA
.OPERATOR
 'X-DIP'
 DIAGONAL
 XDIPLEN
.OPERATOR
 'Y-DIP'
 DIAGONAL
 YDIPLEN
.OPERATOR
 'Z-DIP'
 DIAGONAL
 ZDIPLEN
*END OF

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T,
          DOSORT=T, DOENER=T, DOFOPR=T, DOEXC=F, DOSOPR=F &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &END
 &CCFOPR NEOPER=3, DOMP2G=T, 
   NAMEE='X-DIP','Y-DIP','Z-DIP'
 &END

